//www.sohu.com/a/1085055289_122384684","outlet":"搜狐 (via Bing News search)","lang":"zh","via":"search","state":false,"nc":true,"tier":"specialist","title_en":"Key Signals on the Taiwan Sea: Upgrading of the Fake Marine Patrol and Direct Access to US Military Intelligence Network by the Taiwan Intelligence Group?","summary_en":"In the situation in the Taiwan Strait, people habitually focused on the howling of warplanes, warships cruising, and the smoke of exercises. The growth of numbers, the change of routes, seemed to define it all. However, beyond the hustle and bustle, the Taiwan Coast Guard is undergoing a quiet metamorphosis, which may be a more thought-provoking topic. This maritime patrol team, still a familiar white hull, still uses the name of maritime law enforcement. But behind it, a tightly woven network was quietly woven. The infiltration of military personnel, the construction of tactical networks, the integration of drones, radars, and the growing ties with the United States and the Philippines are all accelerating. For example...","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"屏東縣新增1例本土登革熱病例，請民眾落實「巡、倒、清、刷」，出現疑似症狀儘速就醫","summary":"疾病管制署2026年10月8日公布新增1例本土登革熱病例，為居住屏東縣屏東市40多歲女性，於10月上旬出現發燒、頭痛、肌肉痛、腹瀉等症狀，經就醫並通報採檢送驗後確診登革熱，檢出登革病毒第四型。個案目前住院治療中，同住接觸者目前均無疑似症狀。 疾管署表示，個案潛伏期主要活動地點為屏東縣住家附近，另有鄰近縣市之活動史，無國外旅遊史，研判為本土病例，檢體將進一步定序以釐清可能感染源。衛生單位已針對個案居住地周邊進行緊急化學防治工作、病媒蚊密度調查及環境風險評估，並加強孳生源清除與衛教宣導，同時規劃擴大採檢，呼籲民眾落實防蚊措施並配合相關防治工作，若出現發燒、頭","date":"2026-10-08T06:26","link":"https://www.cdc.gov.tw/Bulletin/Detail/JvaaM_Xplh7dCJenqv0xiw?typeId=9","outlet":"Taiwan CDC","lang":"zh","via":"RSS","state":true,"date_seen":true,"tier":"official","title_en":"In this report, we discussed the case of a newly diagnosed case of dengue fever in Pindong County.","summary_en":"On October 8, 2026, the Disease Control Agency announced a new case of local dengue fever. A woman in her 40s living in Pingtung City, Pingtung County, developed fever, headache, muscle pain, diarrhea and other symptoms in early October. She was diagnosed with dengue fever after receiving medical advice and reporting for inspection. Dengue virus type 4 was detected. The case is currently hospitalized, and there are no suspected symptoms in co-living contacts. The CDC said that the main activity site during the incubation period of the case was near the home in Pingtung County, and there was also a history of activities in nearby counties and cities. There was no history of foreign travel, so it was determined that it was a local case. The samples will be further sequenced to clarify the possible sources of infection. Health units have carried out emergency chemical control work, vector mosquito density surveys and environmental risk assessments around the residential area of the case, and strengthened breeding source removal and hygiene education. At the same time, they plan to expand testing, call on the public to implement mosquito control measures and cooperate with related prevention and control work. If there is a fever,","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"疾管署說明俄羅斯疑似鼠疫事件WHO回復資訊","summary":"疾病管制署(下稱疾管署)2026年10月8日表示，針對近日國際媒體報導俄羅斯西伯利亞伊爾庫茨克州(Irkutsk)鼠疫防治研究所於今(2026)年10月2日報告不明原因肺炎死亡病例，並於10月6日傳出新增第二例疑似鼠疫死亡病例一事。疾管署為嚴密掌握國際疫情狀況，已於10月6日透過我國國際衛生條例(International Health Regulations, IHR)對口單位，函詢世界衛生組織(WHO)以查證相關疫情資訊。 疾管署指出，WHO已於10月7日正式回復。根據WHO提供之資訊，俄羅斯當局於10月6日向WHO說明，伊爾庫茨克州近期並無報告任何","date":"2026-10-08T06:26","link":"https://www.cdc.gov.tw/Bulletin/Detail/ZSgA4XCBC3WbeC0Wb8Em-g?typeId=9","outlet":"Taiwan CDC","lang":"zh","via":"RSS","state":true,"date_seen":true,"tier":"official","title_en":"WHO response to the report of a suspected outbreak in Russia","summary_en":"The Disease Control Agency (hereinafter referred to as CDC) said on October 8, 2026 that in response to recent international media reports that the Institute for Plague Control in Irkutsk, Siberia, Russia, reported unexplained pneumonia deaths on October 2, 2026, and a second suspected plague death was reported on October 6. In order to closely monitor the international epidemic situation, the CDC has sent a letter to the World Health Organization (WHO) on October 6 through the counterpart of China's International Health Regulations (Ihr) to verify the relevant epidemic information. The agency noted that the who had formally responded on 7 October. According to information provided by who, Russian authorities informed who on 6 October that Irkutsk Oblast had not recently reported any","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"歐中貿易談判前 歐盟要求中國限縮油電混合車輸歐遭拒","summary":"（中央社台北8日電）歐盟與中國官員今天起在北京展開2天的貿易談判，受到矚目。英媒引述知情外交人士透露，歐方先前曾提議中方限制油電混合車向歐盟出口，將市占率從逾1/3大減到約15%，否則將被加徵報復性關稅，但遭中方拒絕。","date":"2026-10-08T04:45","link":"https://www.cna.com.tw/news/acn/202610080129.aspx","outlet":"CNA (cross-strait)","lang":"zh","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"The EU refuses to allow China's hybrid vehicles into the European Union before trade talks with China","summary_en":"(Central News Agency, Taipei, 8th) EU and Chinese officials held two days of trade talks in Beijing starting today, which attracted attention. Diplomatic sources familiar with the matter said that the European side had previously proposed that China limit the export of oil and electricity hybrids to the EU, reducing the market share from more than 1/3 to about 15%, otherwise it will be imposed retaliatory tariffs, but China refused.","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":{"n":"Taipei","la":25.053,"lo":121.526,"p":"approx"}},{"title":"Taiwan cooperation key to Indo-Pacific stability: Ex-President Tsai","summary":"San Francisco, Oct. 7 (CNA) Former Taiwan President Tsai Ing-wen (蔡英文) said Wednesday that deeper international cooperation with Taiwan will not only strengthen its security, but also boost stability in the Indo-Pacific and the resilience of other democracies.","date":"20